WEBVTT

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:24.640
What the hell is going on?!

00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:24.420
Damn!

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.770
What the hell were those wolves?

00:02:34.790 --> 00:02:38.860
Considering the fact that they
attacked on the lunar eclipse,

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:40.590
it's probably...

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:42.920
You know something?

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:44.910
The remaining survivors of the Founders.

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:47.270
The Founders?

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:51.690
If I remember correctly, 
there were two survivors.

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:54.610
What are they after?!

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:56.290
It's not us?

00:02:56.950 --> 00:03:01.100
They retreated without finishing us off,

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:02.350
which must mean

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:06.240
they had some other target of higher priority.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:12.120
Another target, huh? Could that possibly be...

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:14.130
Pancake?

00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:20.780
Most likely. She was the only one 
not here during the attack.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:22.620
Why her?

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:25.250
Presumably, they're after her blood.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:31.650
I'm certain they're looking 
for her right this minute.

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:34.850
As if I'll let them!

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.020
Don't.

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:42.150
The Founders exert maximum strength 
during the lunar eclipse.

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:43.740
It's reckless to face them.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:46.710
Who gives a damn?! I won't let them have Yui!

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:04.300
Ruki-kun, are you feeling better?

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:06.800
Yeah.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:10.880
Good. I'm glad.

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:14.310
You...

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:19.210
You really do have the luck 
of the devil, Pancake.

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:22.070
You picked the right time 
to be here with these guys.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:25.570
Ayato-kun? How did you get those cuts?

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:30.160
Were you guys attacked, too?

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:34.700
Yeah.

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:42.400
So you're saying the Founders are behind this?

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:43.670
Yeah.

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:48.680
And they're after...

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:50.610
You, Pancake.

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:52.710
Me?

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:56.150
It seems they're after your blood.

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:58.250
But why?

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:00.200
Hell if I know! Don't ask me.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:02.970
If...

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:08.940
If they are after your blood, 
they'll be here soon.

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:14.200
Once the time comes to 
reach their full strength.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:19.140
No...

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:24.720
I don't want to cause any more 
trouble than I already have.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:25.870
Huh?

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:28.720
If these people are after me,

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:31.800
I don't want all of you to get involved.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:38.730
Don't be stupid! What 
can you do by yourself?!

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:39.740
But...

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:42.280
Unfortunately, he is right.

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:47.960
Leaving you by yourself will make it 
that much easier for them to take you.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:53.210
Besides...

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:54.890
What?

00:05:55.470 --> 00:05:58.180
Vampire powers decrease 
during the lunar eclipse.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:02.170
You purebloods will especially be affected.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.750
What are you getting at?

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.260
We need to work together.

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:10.260
What?

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:13.230
To protect Eve from the Founders.

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:26.460
I guess we have no choice.

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:30.340
Is that all right with you?

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:36.700
I'm asking if you agree.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:41.950
Yes.

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:48.410
But keep this in mind...

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:52.970
I won't let you guys have her.

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:57.980
You know by now, right, Pancake?

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:00.230
You belong to me.

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:18.040
You took the words right out of my mouth.

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:25.480
You're my one and only Eve.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.720
Feel only my fangs on your skin.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.340
I won't let anyone have you.

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:55.210
You're just like what I used to be.

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:03.100
Freedom taken away, imprisoned... 
Perpetually suffering...

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:09.220
But that won't work.

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:14.590
I believe we can become Adam only

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:18.620
when Eve has free will and free choice.

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:23.750
That's why earlier, you asked me...

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:30.070
I wanted to know what you'd want to do.

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:37.860
So I can be chosen as Adam by Eve.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.020
I'm not gonna give up either, masochistic kitten.

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:48.520
That goes without saying.

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:52.520
You're our...

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:58.120
precious Eve.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:43.270
Shall we begin, brother?

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:46.480
Yes.

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:40.550
Pre-ordained destiny... To the future beyond.
